) VALUES (
  'hurricane-patricia-2015', 'Patricia', 'Hurricane Patricia',
  2015, '2015 Pacific', 'EP',
  5, 'Hurricane',
  346, 872,
  '2015-06-01',
  NULL, NULL,
  ARRAY[]::TEXT[],
  'Hurricane Patricia was the most powerful tropical cyclone on record worldwide in terms of maximum sustained winds. It was also the second-most intense on record worldwide in terms of pressure, with a minimum atmospheric pressure of 872 mbar, just behind Typhoon Tip''s 870 mbar. Originating from a sprawling disturbance near the Gulf of Tehuantepec, south of Mexico, in mid-October 2015, Patricia was first classified as a tropical depression on October 20. Initial development was slow, with only mod',
  '## Overview

Hurricane Patricia was the most powerful tropical cyclone on record worldwide in terms of maximum sustained winds. It was also the second-most intense on record worldwide in terms of pressure, with a minimum atmospheric pressure of 872 mbar, just behind Typhoon Tip''s 870 mbar. Originating from a sprawling disturbance near the Gulf of Tehuantepec, south of Mexico, in mid-October 2015, Patricia was first classified as a tropical depression on October 20. Initial development was slow, with only modest strengthening within the first day of its classification. The system later became a tropical storm and was named Patricia, the twenty-fourth named storm of the 2015 Pacific hurricane season. Exceptionally favorable environmental conditions fueled explosive intensification on October 22. A well-defined eye developed within an intense central dense overcast and Patricia grew from a tropical storm to a Category 5 hurricane in just 24 hours—a near-record pace. On October 23, the hurricane achieved its record peak intensity with maximum sustained winds of 215 mph (345 km/h). This made it the most intense tropical cyclone on record in the Western Hemisphere and the strongest globally in terms of one-minute maximum sustained winds.

## Key Facts

See structured data above.

## Sources

- [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Patricia)
- [NOAA NHC](https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/)
',
  ARRAY['Hurricane Patricia reached Category 5 intensity, the highest on the Saffir-Simpson scale.'],
  '[{"title":"Wikipedia — Hurricane Patricia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Patricia","type":"wiki"},{"title":"NOAA National Hurricane Center","url":"https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/","type":"official"}]'::JSONB,
  'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Patricia_2015-10-23_1730Z.jpg/3840px-Patricia_2015-10-23_1730Z.jpg',
  TRUE,
  3
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

